      "text": "A web page section headed \"Internship Timeline\" for the NUS MSc in Digital Financial Technology. A red rectangle encloses an orange-headed table of the FinTech Capstone Project -- key features, internship period, submission and application windows, offer deadlines and the student acceptance grace period. Instructions for posting a position on NUS TalentConnect follow.",
